            <note corresp="#d1001-f8" n="31" xml:id="d1001-f8-content">
                <p>In telegram of October 1, 5 p.m., the Ambassador in China listed 16 bombings of 5
                    different properties of the Methodist Mission, Chungking, in 1939 and 1940
                    (393.1163 M56/247).</p>
            </note>
